title: 'rpc-v2: `chainHead` use `RuntimeUpgraded` digest to determine if the runtime
  changed'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Before we were comparing the `spec_version` of the block against the parent block. Using the `RuntimeUpgraded` digest was exactly introduced for this reason, so we can directly use it here.
crates:
- name: sc-rpc-spec-v2
  bump: patch
